{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nantara Adventures is a roguelike action adventure that focuses on real time combat and resource management mechanics. It is set in the fictional world of Nantara, which is based on the unique Malay Sultanate era. Experience the deep combat system and explore the unique settings in the lore of Nantara.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Roguelike action adventure in a procedurally generated unique world of Nantara. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Grow in virtue or infamy amongst others to become an infamous guild in the golden era of Malay sultanate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Engage with Nantara\u2019s myth and legend which offer a variety of unique power up, allowing multiple potential sets of play styles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Discover various events in the deepest reaches of Nantara, making every expedition a unique experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2456580?t=1760584083","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2456580?t=1760584083","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456580/54db153152160edb2121827af81ee0b15e5027a6/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1760584083","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456580/54db153152160edb2121827af81ee0b15e5027a6/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1760584083","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains fantasy/mild violence, crime, and illegal drugs use."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3991590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb